    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We Escaped a Twisted Game is a two-player, online co-op escape room game. You and your friend are exploring an abandoned manor when you suddenly find yourselves trapped in a twisted game of survival. Use communication, problem-solving, and teamwork skills to escape\u2014and beware of the evil lurking in the shadows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/9c19a4483eb09959e2e755d8bc7f0576.poster.avif?t=1732686882\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/9c19a4483eb09959e2e755d8bc7f0576.webm?t=1732686882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/9c19a4483eb09959e2e755d8bc7f0576.mp4?t=1732686882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/4d741008d7e850939603c6c45bdb2261.webp?t=1732686882\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can't escape alone.</strong> Work together with your partner to progress through the manor. <strong>Communication is key</strong>. Share what you see, but be prepared for your senses to deceive you. <strong>Stay calm</strong> as the clock ticks, the pressure builds, and when you face what lurks in the dark. <strong>Your survival</strong> depends on teamwork, but can you trust each other to the end? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/860c4be8a7749d9ba9032d6ac833bf2f.poster.avif?t=1732686882\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/860c4be8a7749d9ba9032d6ac833bf2f.webm?t=1732686882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/860c4be8a7749d9ba9032d6ac833bf2f.mp4?t=1732686882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLEASE NOTE:</strong> This escape can only be played in co-op. Each player needs their own device and game copy to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/eec85bfce4bc9c53cead4eb8a12640f1.webp?t=1732686882\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the roles of Chad and Stacy, each navigating different parts of the manor. Two distinct paths, but one shared goal: escape together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/473518bb77962f17acd865e2fc40086d.poster.avif?t=1732686882\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/473518bb77962f17acd865e2fc40086d.webm?t=1732686882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/473518bb77962f17acd865e2fc40086d.mp4?t=1732686882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/71b2e283af4589e82439c0cad9a6ca7d.webp?t=1732686882\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover 15 unique rooms, each featuring its own theme, puzzles, and challenges. Dive into a mix of intense brain-teasers, creepy corridors, and teamwork-driven tasks that will put your skills and trust to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/9002473c26dbf563f668a2e7a48c3a11.poster.avif?t=1732686882\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/9002473c26dbf563f668a2e7a48c3a11.webm?t=1732686882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/9002473c26dbf563f668a2e7a48c3a11.mp4?t=1732686882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/39daa3e38b2e68451931c689c1764e44.webp?t=1732686882\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is watching you. Stay alert, trust each other, and survive together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/c7b4a0293670a907443f8f5492319711.poster.avif?t=1732686882\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/c7b4a0293670a907443f8f5492319711.webm?t=1732686882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/c7b4a0293670a907443f8f5492319711.mp4?t=1732686882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/fa589590baefcc7bdb54f93229907958.webp?t=1732686882\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Public lobbies for solo players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Private lobbies for friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game voicechat.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We Escaped a Twisted Game is a two-player, online co-op escape room game. You and your friend are exploring an abandoned manor when you suddenly find yourselves trapped in a twisted game of survival. Use communication, problem-solving, and teamwork skills to escape\u2014and beware of the evil lurking in the shadows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/9c19a4483eb09959e2e755d8bc7f0576.poster.avif?t=1732686882\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/9c19a4483eb09959e2e755d8bc7f0576.webm?t=1732686882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/9c19a4483eb09959e2e755d8bc7f0576.mp4?t=1732686882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/4d741008d7e850939603c6c45bdb2261.webp?t=1732686882\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can't escape alone.</strong> Work together with your partner to progress through the manor. <strong>Communication is key</strong>. Share what you see, but be prepared for your senses to deceive you. <strong>Stay calm</strong> as the clock ticks, the pressure builds, and when you face what lurks in the dark. <strong>Your survival</strong> depends on teamwork, but can you trust each other to the end? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/860c4be8a7749d9ba9032d6ac833bf2f.poster.avif?t=1732686882\" >