ix of intense brain-teasers, creepy corridors, and teamwork-driven tasks that will put your skills and trust to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/9002473c26dbf563f668a2e7a48c3a11.poster.avif?t=1732686882\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/9002473c26dbf563f668a2e7a48c3a11.webm?t=1732686882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/9002473c26dbf563f668a2e7a48c3a11.mp4?t=1732686882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/39daa3e38b2e68451931c689c1764e44.webp?t=1732686882\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is watching you. Stay alert, trust each other, and survive together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/c7b4a0293670a907443f8f5492319711.poster.avif?t=1732686882\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/c7b4a0293670a907443f8f5492319711.webm?t=1732686882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/c7b4a0293670a907443f8f5492319711.mp4?t=1732686882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524930/extras/fa589590baefcc7bdb54f93229907958.webp?t=1732686882\